    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`deapServer` is the local DEAP server module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for local data pipeline server activation, node composition, and runtime topology. Data pipeline behavior belongs in the DEAP modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Local DEAP settings should remain layered, observable, and safe to override."
    }
